# Control of wsl-deps.wdi-outline.map for the question "does Children Wear Anything rescale the outline on a child?" (Virginie, 2026-10-29).
# Same mods, same order. config/wdi-outline-cwaoff turns off the four CWA visual effects (rotation, scaling, body scaling, tattoo scaling) and keeps
# the Venus outline setting on, so the only thing that differs from the wdi-outline pass is CWA's rescaling.
#   Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod VenusTouchWaistlines -DepMap wdi-outline-cwaoff -Filter '25-cwa-kids'   (and the same filter with -DepMap wdi-outline)
